flowchart TD
  A([Datagram arrives]) --> B{Magic, version,<br/>length and CRC-32 OK?}
  B -- no --> B1[Drop silently: BADCRC<br/>no ACK, sender will retransmit]
  B -- yes --> C{Packet type}
  C -- SYN --> D[Create session, sanitise file name,<br/>reply SYN-ACK with rwnd]
  C -- DATA --> E{Protocol}
  E -- GBN / SW --> F{seq == expected?}
  F -- yes --> G[Write payload, expected += 1]
  F -- no --> H[Discard]
  G --> I[Send cumulative ACK]
  H --> I
  E -- SR --> J{seq inside receive window?}
  J -- no, old --> K[Re-ACK duplicate]
  J -- yes --> L[Buffer payload]
  L --> M[Deliver every in-order<br/>buffered packet]
  M --> N[Send ACK: cumulative + selective seq]
  K --> N
  C -- FIN --> O{SHA-256 of received<br/>file matches?}
  O -- yes --> P[Save file, FIN-ACK ok, TIME_WAIT]
  O -- no --> Q[Save as .corrupt, FIN-ACK corrupt]
